    "en": {
      "trackName": "Space Bubbles Watch Game",
      "description": "Space Bubbles Watch Game brings the classic bubble shooter experience to your wrist.\n\nMatch 3 or more bubbles of the same color to pop them.\nClear levels and progress through increasing difficulty.\nUse the aiming guide for precise shots.\nEnjoy smooth gameplay designed for small screens.\nPerfect for quick and fun play sessions.\nPlan your shots, control the angle, and clear the board to complete each level.\nInitial release of Space Bubbles Watch Game.\n70-level gameplay flow added.\nMenu, level selection, audio controls, and in-game overlays implemented.\nBubble pop effects and aiming visuals improved.",
